      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/gmanews/status/2057705068720431400",
      "text": "TRAFFIC ADVISORY:  \n\nThe Department of Public Works and Highways will undertake restoration and reblocking works from May 22 until May 25 in the following areas:  \n\n1. E. Rodriguez Jr. Avenue, from end of approach of Ortigas Flyover (NB) to corner Green Meadows Avenue, Quezon City \n2. C-5 Road, from fronting UP Town Center to the corner of C.P. Garcia Avenue, Quezon City \n3. Quezon Avenue, from corner BIR to fronting Lung Center, Quezon City  \n\nThe activities will be done during nighttime only from 11:00 PM to 5:00 AM. Motorists are advised to take alternate routes.   \n\nCOURTESY: MMDA  \n\nVisit https://t.co/KqDTBMbTQD for updates.",
